      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "2015 BMJ Publishing Group Ltd.",
        "AbstractText": "Osteoporosis commonly causes vertebral collapse fractures. We present a patient with multiple vertebral fractures in the context of severe osteoporosis, who, in the course of investigation for intractable spine and hip pain, was found to have an IgA myeloma. At 2\u2005months post diagnosis, she was discharged home to continue outpatient chemotherapy."
      },
